    IF `the court is about to impose a conditional sentence under section 742.1`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Before imposing a conditional sentence under section 742.1" (a duty whose "before" is unmet, fork F-3)

